Z||000008||FieroJoe||04-06-2001||06:59 PM||||I think that they look great!  I will be eventually doing mine also.  I was hoping I could paint them still on the car, so I wouldnt have to bleed the system again, but I think I just may take them off when I do, just so they come out better.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||theogre||04-06-2001||07:49 PM||||Go to a junk yard, or maybe a parts store, and get some caps for those new bleeders. It will keep out the crap that ate up the surface of the calipers. <P>At the yard... Look for any GM car with the wheels off it and rob the caps off the bleeders.||||reg||1
